; cc.test., served on 127.0.10.3. SOA MINIMUM is 10, so NXDOMAIN is cached for 10 seconds.
cc.test.             3600  IN  SOA    ns1.cc.test. hostmaster.cc.test. 2026110101 7200 3600 1209600 10
cc.test.             3600  IN  NS     ns1.cc.test.
ns1.cc.test.         3600  IN  A      127.0.10.3
www.cc.test.         300   IN  A      127.0.20.1
www.cc.test.         300   IN  AAAA   fd00:cc::1
alias.cc.test.       300   IN  CNAME  web.test.
cc.test.             300   IN  MX     10 mail.cc.test.
mail.cc.test.        300   IN  A      127.0.20.25
cc.test.             300   IN  TXT    "v=spf1 -all"
_http._tcp.cc.test.  300   IN  SRV    10 50 8080 www.cc.test.
; 40 A records: about 690 octets, too big for 512 without EDNS, fine with 1232.
